0..56 Comment "//! `state-wp` observes state as predicate transformers."
57..60 Comment "//!"
61..179 Comment "//! A transformer maps a postcondition and initial state to a precondition. It has type `((A, S) => Type, S) => Type`."
180..183 Comment "//!"
184..414 Comment "//! The handler maps `get` and `put` into state predicates. The scope satisfies state laws. The observation is a monad morphism from state programs. The normaliser computes a precondition through the fold in `tree-state-wp.gandr`."
415..418 Comment "//!"
419..435 Comment "//! - see: #2754"
436..484 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
485..600 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3341708 \"Maillard et al., Dijkstra Monads for All\""
602..632 Comment "// The import gives StateLaws."
